description: Lufia design system conventions; the canonical rules live in AGENTS.md
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repository root first; it is the canonical instruction file for this repository.

- Public, product-agnostic repo: never name or identify consuming apps; say "consuming apps".
- No i18n or app imports; strings come through props; only `--lufia-*` semantic tokens in CSS Modules.
- Do not hand-edit `docs/ai/components/`, `docs/ai/components.json` or `docs/ai/llms*.txt`; run `npm run build:ai-docs`.
- Before finishing: `npm run typecheck`, `npm run lint`, `npm run test`, `npm run verify:ai-docs`.
